{"id":133,"title":"തൃശൂർയിലെ ആശുപത്രിയിൽ പുതിയ ഹൃദ്രോഗ വിഭാഗം","subheadline":"പ്രവൃത്തികൾ ഘട്ടം ഘട്ടമായി പൂർത്തിയാക്കുമെന്ന് അധികൃതർ അറിയിച്ചു","url":"/thiruvananthapuram/trrishuryile-ashupatriyil-putiya-hrridroga-vibhagam","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/thiruvananthapuram/trrishuryile-ashupatriyil-putiya-hrridroga-vibhagam","image":{"id":58,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-288.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-288.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"primary_category":{"id":21,"name":"Thiruvananthapuram","slug":"thiruvananthapuram","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/thiruvananthapuram"},"reporter":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T02:43:36.777787+05:30","last_major_update_at":null,"reading_time":1,"language":"ml","flags":{"is_breaking":false,"is_premium":true,"has_video":false},"hero_image":{"id":58,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-288.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-288.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"featured_image_caption":"","featured_image_credit":"Stockholm (Picsum #288)","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>പ്രവൃത്തികൾ ഘട്ടം ഘട്ടമായി പൂർത്തിയാക്കുമെന്ന് അധികൃതർ അറിയിച്ചു. നാട്ടുകാർക്ക് ബുദ്ധിമുട്ട് ഉണ്ടാകാതിരിക്കാൻ പ്രത്യേക ശ്രദ്ധ നൽകും.</p>","id":"968ff3cf-52dd-468f-bcc6-0d94680cc4b1"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>ഏറെക്കാലമായുള്ള ആവശ്യമാണ് യാഥാർഥ്യമാകുന്നതെന്ന് ജനപ്രതിനിധികൾ പറഞ്ഞു. വിശദമായ സമയക്രമം അടുത്ത ആഴ്ച പ്രസിദ്ധീകരിക്കും.</p>","id":"6601eaec-72ae-4ab1-be36-ce1615593742"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>പരാതികൾ അറിയിക്കാൻ ജില്ലാ ഭരണകൂടം ഹെൽപ് ഡെസ്ക് തുറന്നിട്ടുണ്ട്.</p>","id":"31e522cc-4a39-4252-ad12-ceeeff63217f"}],"live_updates":[],"corrections":[],"reporter_profile":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair","designation":"Correspondent","beat":"Sports and Business, Kochi","bio":"Rahul reports on sports and business from Kochi, with a focus on football and start-ups.","photo":null,"social":{"x":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null,"linkedin":null}},"categories":[{"id":21,"name":"Thiruvananthapuram","slug":"thiruvananthapuram","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/thiruvananthapuram"},{"id":3,"name":"Keralam News","slug":"kerala-news","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/kerala-news"}],"tags":[{"name":"kerala","slug":"kerala","url":"/tag/kerala"},{"name":"thiruvananthapuram","slug":"thiruvananthapuram","url":"/tag/thiruvananthapuram"},{"name":"monsoon","slug":"monsoon","url":"/tag/monsoon"}],"location":"","district":"","is_featured":true,"is_editors_pick":false,"is_premium":true,"premium_gate_ready":false,"allow_ads":true,"word_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:32:29.082887+05:30","breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Home","url":"/"},{"name":"Keralam News","url":"/kerala-news"},{"name":"Thiruvananthapuram","url":"/thiruvananthapuram"},{"name":"തൃശൂർയിലെ ആശുപത്രിയിൽ പുതിയ ഹൃദ്രോഗ വിഭാഗം","url":"/thiruvananthapuram/trrishuryile-ashupatriyil-putiya-hrridroga-vibhagam"}],"seo":{"title":"തൃശൂർയിലെ ആശുപത്രിയിൽ പുതിയ ഹൃദ്രോഗ വിഭാഗം","description":"പ്രവൃത്തികൾ ഘട്ടം ഘട്ടമായി പൂർത്തിയാക്കുമെന്ന് അധികൃതർ അറിയിച്ചു","og_image":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-_z0TGgwB.2e16d0ba.fill-1200x630.format-jpeg.jpegquality-85.jpg","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/thiruvananthapuram/trrishuryile-ashupatriyil-putiya-hrridroga-vibhagam","noindex":false,"published_time":"2026-11-10T02:43:36.777787+05:30","modified_time":"2026-11-19T09:32:29.082887+05:30"},"alternate_version":null,"related":[{"id":93,"title":"കൊച്ചി Smart City project: രണ്ടാം ഘട്ടം ഉടൻ","subheadline":"പദ്ധതിയുടെ രണ്ടാം ഘട്ടം ഉടൻ ആരംഭിക്കുമെന്ന് അധികൃതർ അറിയിച്ചു","url":"/thiruvananthapuram/kochchi-smart-city-proje